From ee0f280faaba324395bbb3f5405fbe59d7d32392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abumalick <8377185+abumalick@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:46:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for the OSC 7501 program status protocol.

A program can report its status (idle, working, done, blocked or error)
with OSC 7501 and probe for support with "OSC 7501 ; ?". Answer the probe
and keep the root record of each pane, exposed in the pane_program_state,
pane_program_kind, pane_program_app and pane_program_time formats and
announced by a pane-program-changed hook. Child records (with an id) are
ignored. As the protocol asks, working and blocked are dropped when the
program exits or a new OSC 133 prompt starts, and RIS clears the record.
---
